<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Tuborg</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>drink tuborg
</pre>
<p>Tuborg is a very famous and great tasting Danish beer. In Valhalla a 
bottle of Green Tuborg brings you new energy: drink it, and it gives you 
back 25 endurance points, and quenches your thirst and hunger a little.
</p><p>You can only drink it when you are thirsty. Sip or taste it and you will 
find the taste nothing less than divine, but it does nothing more.
</p><p>It costs a copper piece or so in the taverns of Midgaard and at the 
guilds' bars, and Odin's statue gives one to those who pray to it (see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Odin Statue</a>).
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
